abstract: >-
  An enterprise Quality Engineering framework for using Playwright through the
  Model Context Protocol while preserving application authentication,
  authorization and security boundaries. The work defines an
  Intent-Session-Capability-Authorization-Evidence-Gate model spanning browser
  profiles, storage state, least-privilege identities, MCP tools, prompt
  injection, consequential actions, human approval, deterministic evidence,
  observability, self-healing boundaries, agent evaluation, CI/CD quality gates
  and governed conversion of exploratory agent workflows into durable
  Playwright regression tests.
